<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#societyStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The current operational status of an initiatory society. Range: iroko:SocietyStatusScheme concepts (active, historical, reformed, forcibly-dissolved). A forcibly-dissolved society's archival records retain their access restrictions — dissolution by external authority does not transfer governance to the suppressing power or to the public."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SocietyStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-ekpe> .
