<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#gov-hereditary-title> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Key titles pass within specific families or lineages. Characteristic of some Egungun and Agemo societies."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#dissolutionAuthority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#conferral-purchase> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Title conferred in exchange for a defined payment or contribution to the society. Common in some Ékpè and Abakuá grade structures."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#society-ekpe> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ékpè / Ngbe"@fr .
