<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#gov-hierarchical-grade> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Authority flows through a defined sequence of grades; higher grades govern lower. Characteristic of Ékpè, Abakuá, and similar tiered societies."@en .
