<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#society-poro> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The male initiatory bush school society widespread among Mande, Kpelle, Temne, and neighboring peoples of Sierra Leone, Liberia, and Guinea. Poro manages male initiation, education, and community governance through a graded forest-based curriculum."@en .
