<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#society-abakua> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Abakuá"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#societyStatus-historical> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The society is no longer operating but was not forcibly dissolved — it ceased through natural discontinuity, succession failure, or community decision."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#masqueradeFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ceremonial function of this masquerade. Range: iroko:MasqueradeFunctionScheme."@en .
