<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#societyStatus-forcibly-dissolved> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The society was suppressed by an external authority — colonial administration, state government, or occupying power — rather than ceasing through internal process. Records held by a forcibly dissolved society do not become public as a result of the dissolution. See also: iroko:ForcedDissolution."@en .
