<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#representedEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ancestral spirit, principle, or force embodied by this masquerade. Range: iroko:SpiritualEntity. Initiated-only: the identity of what a masquerade embodies is esoteric in many traditions."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#dissolutionAuthority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dissolution authority"@en .
