<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#TitleConferralScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#conferral-senior-nomination> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#society-oro> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#membershipGrade> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The grade held by this member."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#society-sande> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The female counterpart to Poro, managing female initiation among Mende, Temne, and neighboring peoples. Sande is distinctive in African contexts as a society where women wear and operate the sacred Sowei helmet mask."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#membershipDate> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-community-only> .
