<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#masqueradeInsignia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Description of costume elements, materials, and identifying features. Initiated-elder only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-ekpe> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-03-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#representedEntity> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-initiated-only> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#societyStatus-active> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The society is currently operating, initiating members, and exercising its governance functions."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#societyType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "society type"@en .
