<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#TitleConferralScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#conferral-spiritual-designation> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#conferral-hereditary> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Title passes within a family or lineage by birthright or elder designation."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mask-function-ancestral-embodiment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#MasqueradeFunctionScheme> .
