<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#gov-consensus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#GovernanceStructureScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mask-function-healing> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The masquerade carries healing or protective power for the community or individual supplicants."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#gradePrivileges> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-ekpe> .
