<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#lodgeName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The public name of the lodge or potencia. In Abakuá: the potencia name (e.g., Efik Butón, Efik Efor). Community-restricted for active lodges; public for historical lodges documented in scholarly sources."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#representedEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SocietyMasquerade> .
