<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mask-function-society-voice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The masquerade carries and communicates the voice or authority of the society. Function of Abakuá íremes and Ékpè masquerades."@en .
